creatures:
- name: Hobgoblin Captain
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 58 (rollable(dice=9d8 + 18,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Initiative) (14)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Gear** greatsword, half plate armor, longbow  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** Common, Goblin  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Aura of Authority.*** While in a 10-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the hobgoblin, the hobgoblin and its allies have ***Advantage*** on attack rolls and saving throws, provided the hobgoblin doesn't have the ***Incapacitated*** condition.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The hobgoblin makes two attacks, using Greatsword or Longbow in any combination.

      ***Greatsword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Greatsword]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+2,dicelabel=Damage [Greatsword]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Greatsword]) Poison damage.

      ***Longbow.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Longbow]), range 150/600 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+2,dicelabel=Damage [Longbow]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Longbow]) Poison damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
